---Configuration settings for after contact work (ACW) timeout.
---@class aws.connect.AfterContactWorkConfig
---@field AfterContactWorkTimeLimit? aws.connect.AfterContactWorkTimeLimit The after contact work (ACW) timeout duration in seconds. Minimum: 1 second. Maximum: 2,000,000 seconds (24 days). For the CHAT channel, the maximum for a specific duration is 5,400 seconds (90 minutes); higher values end ACW after 90 minutes. For all channels, including chat, you can enter 0 for an indefinite amount of time, meaning agents must manually choose to end ACW.

