---Latest routing criteria on the contact.
---@class aws.connect.RoutingCriteria
---@field Steps? aws.connect.Steps List of routing steps. When Connect Customer does not find an available agent meeting the requirements in a step for a given step duration, the routing criteria will move on to the next step sequentially until a join is completed with an agent. When all steps are exhausted, the contact will be offered to any agent in the queue.
---@field ActivationTimestamp? aws.connect.Timestamp The timestamp indicating when the routing criteria is set to active. A routing criteria is activated when contact is transferred to a queue. ActivationTimestamp will be set on routing criteria for contacts in agent queue even though Routing criteria is never activated for contacts in agent queue.
---@field Index? aws.connect.Index Information about the index of the routing criteria.

---An object to define the RoutingCriteria.
