---@field Steps? aws.connect.RoutingCriteriaInputSteps When Connect Customer does not find an available agent meeting the requirements in a step for a given step duration, the routing criteria will move on to the next step sequentially until a join is completed with an agent. When all steps are exhausted, the contact will be offered to any agent in the queue.

---Step defines the list of agents to be routed or route based on the agent requirements such as ProficiencyLevel, Name, or Value.
